    {
      "name": "dsh-menu-hidden",
      "title": {
        "zh": "菜单隐藏",
        "en": "Menu Hiding"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "添加「重启 / 刷新」菜单，侧边栏项目、官方模型分组、重复选项卡一键隐藏；还能改默认推理等级，避免 API 中转站获取不到推理强度。",
        "en": "Adds Reload and Restart to the application menu, hides the sidebar items, the official model groups and the duplicate tabs in one switch, and sets the default reasoning level so API relays that report no reasoning strength still show one."
      },
